**Security decisions made:**
1. Used `marked` with default options (doesn't parse raw HTML in markdown by default)
2. Sanitized output with DOMPurify using explicit allowlist for tags/attributes
3. Added custom hooks to enforce `https:`/`http:`/`/`/`#` only for links and images
4. Forced `rel="noopener noreferrer"` and `target="_blank"` on external links
5. Stripped all event handlers (`on*`), `style` attributes, and dangerous tags
6. Used `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` only with DOMPurify-sanitized output (safe per CSP rules)
